hapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"季高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0079","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0195","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"沈君高（字季高，諡祁子），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_A","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-chen023-jungao-brother"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","quote":"君理第六弟君高，字季高，少知名，性剛直，有吏能。以家門外戚，早居清顯，歷太子舍人、洗馬、中舍人、高宗司空府從事中郎、廷尉卿。太建元年，東境大水，百姓飢弊，乃以君高為貞威將軍、吳令。尋除太子中庶子、尚書吏部郎、衛尉卿。出為宣遠將軍、平南長沙王長史、南海太守，行廣州事。以女為王妃，固辭不行，復為衛尉卿。八年，詔授持節、都督廣等十八州諸軍事、寧遠將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史。嶺南俚、獠世相攻伐，君高本文吏，無武幹，推心撫御，甚得民和。十年，卒于官，時年四十七。贈散騎常侍，諡曰祁子。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0000","source_term":"君理第六弟君高","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-jungao-brother"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001","quote":"沈君理字仲倫，吳興人也。祖僧畟，梁左民尚書。父巡，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。荊州陷，蕭詧署金紫光祿大夫。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0023","source_term":"父巡","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"依本傳兄弟明文與君理父巡兩則原句暫接父系。"}},{"id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_ADA","label":"沈遵禮（沈君高子，為君理嗣）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"遵禮","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"遵禮"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"沈遵禮（沈君高子，為君理嗣），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_AD","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-zunli-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004","quote":"太建元年，服闋，除太子詹事，行東宮事，遷吏部尚書。二年，高宗以君理女為皇太子妃，賜爵望蔡縣侯，邑五百戶。四年，加侍中。五年，遷尚書右僕射，領吏部，侍中如故。其年有疾，輿駕親臨視，九月卒，時年四十九。詔贈侍中、太子少傅。喪事所須，隨由資給。重贈翊左將軍、開府儀同三司，侍中如故。諡曰貞憲。君理子遵儉早卒，以弟君高子遵禮為嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0153","source_term":"弟君高子遵禮"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"以君高之子遵禮嗣君理；此條只表本生。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156"],"paragraph_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0156"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_s